  "post_content": "<p>La asociaci&oacute;n Popar i Criar de Onda ha iniciado la tarde de este martes, en el Centro de Empleo y Cultura, el curso 2013-14 con una charla sobre primeros auxilios pedi&aacute;tricos, a cargo de la enfermera Mar&iacute;a &Aacute;ngeles Pallar&eacute;s.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_2060.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Antes, la psic&oacute;loga Rosa Barcel&oacute; ha explicado los fines de la asociaci&oacute;n y las pr&oacute;ximas charlas programadas, como sobre celos entre hermanos, problemas de sue&ntilde;o o alimentaci&oacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarprimersauxilis/img_2058.jpg\" alt=\"img_2058\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarprimersauxilis/img_2059.jpg\" alt=\"img_2059\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarprimersauxilis/img_2060.jpg\" alt=\"img_2060\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarprimersauxilis/img_2061.jpg\" alt=\"img_2061\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarprimersauxilis/img_2062.jpg\" alt=\"img_2062\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarprimersauxilis/img_2063.jpg\" alt=\"img_2063\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarprimersauxilis/img_2064.jpg\" alt=\"img_2064\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/poparicriarprimersauxilis/img_2065.jpg\" alt=\"img_2065\" style=\"max-